{
 "_readme": "Declarative recipe for model.js (read by tools/build.py). datasets = survey files (paths come from tools/sources.csv); each factor says which column of each dataset gives its answer code. Rule types: yn, raw, map(+default), num(thresholds,codes[,extract=first_int]), anyyes(cols). A factor/dataset pair with no rule is simply not counted. See tools/README.md.",
 "prior": 0.101,
 "prior_note": "P(D) for Thai adults, from the project summary file; replaces the US prevalence of the survey",
